  <description>
    <p>
      CRT Spaceship is an endless retro-style space shooter with authentic CRT
      terminal aesthetics. Pilot a phosphor-green ship, blast waves of enemies,
      and chase high scores — all in a tiny HTML5 Canvas game with procedural
      Web Audio sound and zero runtime dependencies.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Endless wave-based gameplay with rising difficulty</li>
      <li>Mouse, touch, and keyboard controls</li>
      <li>Scanlines, vignette, and phosphor glow CRT look</li>
      <li>Procedural shoot, explosion, and ambience audio</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
